    "intro_narrative": "The world ended in nuclear fire decades ago, leaving the surface a barren, irradiated wasteland. You are a Scavenger who has just stumbled upon the legendary Outpost Zero, a forgotten subterranean bunker rumored to house a functional life-support reactor. The air is stale, the emergency lights flicker ominously, and dust covers the dormant machinery. Your objective is clear: reactivate the bunker's systems and ignite the main power core to restore hope to the survivors above. You must navigate the complex web of abandoned terminals and scavenge through the ruins to find a way to power up the facility.",
    "narrative_style": "post_apocalyptic"
